a Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">DeepSeek引入联想系等资本并聘请中信证券启动IPO进程</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Anthropic联手Theorem Labs利用Claude完成1.8亿行形式化验证</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Anthropic将Agent Skills标准捐赠给Linux基金会旗下AAIF</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌发布智能体计算引擎ACE，为AI智能体提供专属微型虚拟机环境</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/ef68ff4c5f582ea687e38f4a06f7efe3.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌于10月22日正式推出智能体计算引擎（Agent Compute Engine，简称ACE），旨在为AI智能体提供安全、持久且可弹性伸缩的专属计算环境。ACE通过为每个智能体分配硬件隔离的微型虚拟机（microVM），支持智能体安全地运行代码、调用工具及操作浏览器。该环境具备独立的客户内核与根权限，并利用Cloud Hypervisor实现硬件边界隔离，有效降低数据外泄风险。ACE的核心优势在于其“持久且可暂停”的特性，在20万个智能体的压测中，环境暂停与恢复的唤醒时间不到500毫秒，大幅提升了单台服务器的智能体承载密度。目前，ACE已服务于Gemini平台及谷歌内部模型评估流程，未来开发者可通过Google Cloud直接调用，自行管理智能体环境的镜像、身份与生命周期，底层资源调度则由谷歌负责。该引擎通过</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">SpaceX 与特斯拉拟合并，马斯克欲整合汽车、火箭与 AI 业务</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/ce74afa38ed5795a1b5d3ca55ae39f94.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">SpaceX 与特斯拉已各自成立特别委员会，正式启动合并事宜的讨论。此次合并旨在整合特斯拉的自动驾驶、人形机器人技术与 SpaceX 的大模型及算力基础设施，构建一个能自主决策的 AI 机器人帝国。财务数据显示，SpaceX 第三季度“超级智能”部门营收达 75.6 亿美元，其中算力租赁业务贡献显著。双方此前已在 Terafab 晶圆厂及 Macrohard AI 项目上展开合作。分析指出，合并的核心驱动力在于消除内部利益冲突，并解决对英伟达 GPU 等稀缺资源的争夺。通过以 SpaceX 为收购方的换股合并，马斯克有望巩固对合并后实体的绝对投票控制权，并可能借此解锁特斯拉薪酬方案中的巨额股权。若交易达成，合并后的资本支出预计将大幅攀升，现有 SpaceX 股东权益或面临稀释。目前市场传闻该交易计划于 2027</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">DeepSeek引入联想系等资本并聘请中信证券启动IPO进程</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/62b95176ef495da074de7b835cd89d91.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">大模型独角兽DeepSeek近期完成新一轮融资，成功引入君联资本、石溪资本及吉利等多家产业与财务投资者，联想系资本正式进入其股东阵营。DeepSeek已于今年9月聘请中信证券担任顾问，最快有望于2027年初推进IPO进程。在资本合作前，联想已将DeepSeek技术全面适配至AI PC、服务器及企业AI解决方案中。此次融资标志着双方合作从技术适配升级至资本与产业生态深度协同。对于行业而言，此举显示头部大模型厂商正加速向资本化与产业生态融合阶段演进，通过引入产业资本强化终端与基础设施的业务联动，进一步巩固其在AI生态中的竞争壁垒。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Anthropic联手Theorem Labs利用Claude完成1.8亿行形式化验证</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/913c5611c44d3700de2470664f5bd30d.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Anthropic与Theorem Labs合作，利用Claude模型对RISC-V汇编指令及生产级开源代码库进行形式化验证。在数周内，Claude完成了123个开源代码库、239个测试入口的分析，产出1.8亿行Rocq数学证明代码。该方法将测试入口转译为数学命题，实现全路径覆盖，成功识别出模糊测试（fuzzing）难以发现的隐秘漏洞、逻辑死角及x86硬件缺陷。Claude不仅能定位漏洞，还具备自动生成补丁并进行二次验证的能力。目前，该验证效率以每两个月翻一番的速度增长，首批证明已公开。按此路径，预计投入1.34亿美元，至2027年底可完成Nix生态95%的机器码验证。此举标志着AI在底层软件安全领域实现从随机测试到数学证明的范式转移，显著降低了高工程量形式化验证的门槛。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Anthropic将Agent Skills标准捐赠给Linux基金会旗下AAIF</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/b0a5de56a69418894ab836e18b192464.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Anthropic于10月22日宣布，将其Agent Skills开放标准正式捐赠给Linux基金会旗下的Agentic AI Foundation（AAIF），旨在推动智能体能力规范的社区化治理。Agent Skills本质上是一套智能体“说明书”，通过包含SKILL.md文件、脚本及模板的文件夹，实现特定任务与领域知识在不同AI产品间的复用。自2025年12月发布以来，该标准已获ChatGPT、Cursor、GitHub Copilot及VS Code等70多个平台集成，公开技能数量近100万个，累计安装量约2.8亿次。此次捐赠涵盖了名称、标志、GitHub组织及agentskills.io域名。Anthropic强调，该标准将保持供应商中立，开发者无需加入AAIF即可使用或贡献。此举意在将智能体能力的底层</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
